      "content": "<p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001046062\" style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">Bengaluru has many outer ring road (ORR) locations and prestige tech park is a well-known IT park in Bengaluru, located on the ORR,, surrounded by rapidly developing residential neighborhoods. Choosing where to live near Prestige Tech Park can make a big difference in commuting to your workplace, your way of life, and how you access amenities. This article will cover some of the best residential areas to live near Prestige Tech Park, and provide an overview regarding connectivity, amenities, and housing.<br></span></p><h2 style=\"margin: 15pt 0px 3pt; line-height: 1.5;\"><b><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Key Takeaways</span><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocyuo0rt8m0lag\",\"id\":\"toc_qe7w9io2sbl8\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_qe7w9io2sbl8\">&nbsp;</span><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocyuo0rt8m0lag\",\"id\":\"toc_qe7w9io2sbl8\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_qe7w9io2sbl8\">&nbsp;</span></b></h2><p style=\"margin: 15pt 0px 3pt; line-height: 1.5;\"></p><ul></ul><p></p><ul><li><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">The best residential localities near Prestige Tech Park are Bellandur, Marathahalli, and Kadubeesanahalli.</span></li><li style=\"margin: 15pt 0px 3pt; line-height: 1.5;\">These areas have an eclectic mix of residential options, from gated communities to apartments.</li><li style=\"margin: 15pt 0px 3pt; line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">They have great connectivity via the ORR, new metro lines coming, and are well located if you have kids nearby, know hospitals, or the malls.</span></li><li style=\"margin: 15pt 0px 3pt; line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Others are along Panathur Road, Whitefield, Brookefield.</span></li><li><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001046062\" style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">The locality you prefer will come down to your family's budget, social lifestyle preference, and work commute</span></span></li></ul><h2 style=\"margin: 12pt 0px 6pt; line-height: 1.6;\"><b><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><br>Understanding the Prestige Tech Park Location and Its Surroundings</span><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocyn8ckt73iqf9\",\"id\":\"toc_4cwsp70ce7p8\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_4cwsp70ce7p8\">&nbsp;</span><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocyn8ckt73iqf9\",\"id\":\"toc_4cwsp70ce7p8\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_4cwsp70ce7p8\">&nbsp;</span></b></h2><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001046062\" style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Kadubeesanahalli is where Prestige Tech Park resides, along the Outer Ring Road which is an important IT corridor in Bangalore. The Park is surrounded by many major residential localities that have grown rapidly due to IT professionals moving into the area.&nbsp;<br></span></span></span></p><table class=\"table table-bordered\"><tbody><tr><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001046062\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><b>Feature</b></span></p></td><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001046062\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><b>Details</b></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001046062\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">Location</span></p></td><td><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"10.50\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" data-doc-id=\"3105201000001046062\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Kadubeesanahalli, Outer Ring Road, Bangalore</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001046062\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">Nearby Localities</span></p></td><td><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"10.50\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" data-doc-id=\"3105201000001046062\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Bellandur, Marathahalli, Panathur, Whitefield, Brookefield</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"10.50\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" data-doc-id=\"3105201000001046062\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Distance to Airport</span></p></td><td><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"10.50\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" data-doc-id=\"3105201000001046062\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Approx. 45 km (Kempegowda International Airport)</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Distance to Majestic Station</p></td><td><p>18.5 km</p></td></tr><tr><td><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"10.50\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" data-doc-id=\"3105201000001046062\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Connectivity</span></p></td><td><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"10.50\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" data-doc-id=\"3105201000001046062\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Bus routes, upcoming metro (Blue Line)</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001046062\" style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">The Outer Ring Road also connects these localities with other important IT clusters in Bangalore such as Whitefield, Bellandur and Electronic City which are good for professionals who work in the area at Prestige Tech Park.</span></span></span></p><h2><b><br>Bellandur</b></h2><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001046062\" style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><b><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"></span></b></span></p><p><a href=\"https://www.kots.world/blog/the-rise-of-bellandur-whats-the-buzz-all-about\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">Bellandur</a> is located on the ORR between Marathahalli and Koramangala, about 2-3 km away from Prestige Tech Park. This neighborhood has quickly become a popular residential area for IT professionals.</p><h3><br>Key Features</h3><ul><li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Great connectivity to important IT parks and business districts.</span></li><li>Variety of housing options such as apartments, gated communities, and serviced apartments.<br><br></li></ul><p></p><ul></ul><p></p><h3 style=\"margin: 15pt 0px 3pt; line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Lifestyle and Amenities</span><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_toc1qkaaw1q02i5\",\"id\":\"toc_vw8cj5uu9jok\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_vw8cj5uu9jok\">&nbsp;</span><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_toc1qkaaw1q02i5\",\"id\":\"toc_vw8cj5uu9jok\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_vw8cj5uu9jok\">&nbsp;</span></h3><p></p><ul><ul></ul></ul><p></p><p></p><ul></ul><p></p><ul><li style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b>Schools</b>:Narayana E techno schools, ORCHIDS The International School, Royale Concorde School<br></span></li><li style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\"><b>Healthcare</b>: Sakra World Hospital, Manipal Hospital, Cloudnine Hospital.<br></li><li style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\"><b>Shopping</b>: KLM Mall,Centro Mall</li></ul><table class=\"table table-bordered\"><tbody><tr><td><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" size\":\"10.50\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" data-doc-id=\"3105201000001046062\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><b>Feature</b></span></p></td><td><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" size\":\"10.50\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" data-doc-id=\"3105201000001046062\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><b>Bellandur</b></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"10.50\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" data-doc-id=\"3105201000001046062\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Distance to Prestige Tech Park</span></p></td><td><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"10.50\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" data-doc-id=\"3105201000001046062\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\" 