      "content": "<h2><b><br>Kadubeesanahalli</b></h2><p>Kadubeesanahalli is the immediate vicinity of Prestige Tech Park and has a peaceful and residential ambiance.</p><h3><br></h3><h3>Key Features</h3><ul><li>Being very close to the tech park shortens commute significantly.</li><li>The area is primarily premium apartments and gated communities.</li><li>It has very little commercial activity which contributes to tranquility and suitable for families.<br></li></ul><h3><br>Lifestyle and Amenities</h3><ul><li><b>Schools : </b>Orchids International  School , New Horizon Gurukul</li><li><b>Health Care: </b>Sakra World Hospital,  ARK Advanced Multispeciality Hospital Clinic and Diagnostic Centre within a short drive<br></li><li><b>Shopping malls: </b>Centro Mall , KLM Mall</li></ul><p><br></p><table class=\"table table-bordered\"><tbody><tr><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001046062\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><b>Feature</b></span></p></td><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001046062\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><b>Kadubeesanahalli</b></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001046062\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">Distance to Prestige Tech Park</span></p></td><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001046062\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">Adjacent</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001046062\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">Housing Options</span></p></td><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001046062\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">Premium Apartments, Serviced Apartments,Gated Apartments</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"10.50\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" data-doc-id=\"3105201000001046062\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Average Property Price</span></p></td><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001046062\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">₹9,000 - ₹10,000 per sq ft</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001046062\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">Connectivity</span></p></td><td><p>ORR, Sarjapur Road, Old Airport Road and Bellandur Road Railway Station,Bus and  metro (Upcoming Blue line) </p></td></tr></tbody></table><p></p><h2><b><br>Panathur Road</b></h2>Panathur Road lies between Whitefield and Southeast Bangalore and is gaining popularity due to its strategic location.<br><br><h3><br>Key Features<br></h3><ul><li>Living close to the tech park greatly reduces commute time.<br></li><li>Growing number of residential projects catering to diverse budgets.</li></ul><h3><br>Lifestyle and Amenities</h3><ul><li><b>Schools :</b>VIBGYOR and ORCHIDS The International School<br></li><li><b>Health Care:</b>Fostr Healthcare Multi-Specialty Health Clinic,Maya Hospital (Multispecialty)<br></li><li><b>Shopping malls: </b>KLM Fashion Mall and Mango hypermarket</li></ul><p></p><table class=\"table table-bordered\"><tbody><tr><td><p><b>Feature</b></p></td><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001046062\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><b>Panathur Road</b></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001046062\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">Distance to Prestige Tech Park</span></p></td><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001046062\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">5-6 km</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Housing Options</p></td><td><p>Apartments, Gated Communities</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Average Property Price</p></td><td><p>₹13,000 per sq ft</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Connectivity</p></td><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001046062\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">ORR, Old Airport Road, and ITPL Main Road, Bus and Metro Blue line upcoming</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><h2><b><br>Whitefield</b></h2><p>With its bustling IT hubs and healthy living spaces, Whitefield is one of the fast-growing prominent localities in East Bangalore, and continues to attract both homebuyers as well as investors for its superior amenities and convenience.<br><br></p><h3>Key features</h3><ul><li>Close to major tech parks like Prestige Tech Park, ITPL, and EPIP Zone.</li><li>Diverse residential supply, from affordable <a href=\"https://www.kots.world/bangalore/flats-for-rent-in-whitefield\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">apartments in whitefield</a> to luxury gated communities.<br><br></li></ul><h3>Lifestyle and Amenities</h3><ul><li><b>Schools : </b>The Deens Academy, Vydehi School of Excellence, and Glentree Academy.<br></li><li><b>Health Care:</b> Manipal Hospital, Vydehi Hospital, and Cloudnine Hospital.<br></li><li><b>Shopping malls</b>: Phoenix Marketcity, VR Bengaluru, and Nexus Shantiniketan Mall.</li></ul><p><br></p><p></p><table class=\"table table-bordered\"><tbody><tr><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001046062\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><b>Feature</b></span></p></td><td><p><b>Whitefield</b></p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Distance to Prestige Tech Park</p></td><td><p>8–10 km</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Housing Options</p></td><td><p>Apartments, Villas, Gated Communities</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Average Property Price</p></td><td><p>₹11,000–₹13,500 per sq ft</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001046062\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">Connectivity</span></p></td><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001046062\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">Whitefield Main Road, ORR, Metro (Purple Line operational), Bus, Suburban Rail</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p></p><h2><b><br>Brookefield</b></h2><p>Brookefield is an established and fast-growing locality in East Bangalore, with the best of residential settlement and commercial connectivity. The availability of excellent infrastructure and proximity to a well-developed IT corridor makes it a preferred destination for families and working professionals. <br></p><h3><br></h3><h3>Key Features</h3><ul><li>Its close proximity to a well-developed IT corridor makes it a popular choice for both families and working professionals.</li><li>A range of housing, ranging from apartments and villas to gated communities, that suits different budgets</li></ul><h3><br>Lifestyle and Amenities</h3><ul><li><b>Schools </b>:  Gopalan International School; National Public School (NPS) – Whitefield; and Ryan International School</li><li><b>Health Care:</b> Brookefield Hospital, Apollo Clinic and Aayug Multi Speciality Hospital<br></li><li><b>Shopping malls:</b> Brookefield Mall, Nexus Shantiniketan, and Phoenix Marketcity.</li></ul><p><br></p><p></p><table class=\"table table-bordered\"><tbody><tr><td><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001046062\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><b>Feature</b></span></td><td><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001046062\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><b>Brookefield</b></span></td></tr><tr><td><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001046062\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">Distance to Prestige Tech Park</span></td><td><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001046062\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">5–7 km</span></td></tr><tr><td><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001046062\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">Housing Options</span></td><td><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001046062\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">Apartments, Villas, Gated Communities</span></td></tr><tr><td><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001046062\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">Average Property Price</span></td><td><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001046062\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">₹10,500–₹13,000 per sq ft</span></td></tr><tr><td><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001046062\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">Connectivity</span></td><td><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001046062\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">ITPL Main Road, Varthur Road, ORR, Bus, Metro (Purple Line nearby via Kundalahalli)</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p></p><p><br></p><h2><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Rental Price</span></h2><table class=\"table table-bordered\"><tbody><tr><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001046062\" style=\"font-family: fkGroteskNeue, \" fkgroteskneue=\"\" fallback\",=\"\" ui-sans-serif,=\"\" system-ui,=\"\" -apple-system,=\"\" blinkmacsystemfont,=\"\" \"segoe=\"\" ui\",=\"\" roboto,=\"\" \"helvetica=\"\" neue\",=\"\" arial,=\"\" \"noto=\"\" sans\",=\"\" sans-serif,=\"\" \"apple=\"\" color=\"\" emoji\",=\"\" ui=\"\" symbol\",=\"\" emoji\";=\"\" color:=\"\" rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0);=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 10.5pt;=\"\" vertical-align:=\"\" baseline;\"=\"\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><b>Area</b></span></p></td><td><p><b>Distance to Prestige Tech Park</b></p></td><td><p><b> Housing Types</b></p></td><td><p><b>Avg Rent Studio (₹/month)</b></p></td><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001046062\" style=\"font-family: fkGroteskNeue, \" fkgroteskneue=\"\" fallback\",=\"\" ui-sans-serif,=\"\" system-ui,=\"\" -apple-system,=\"\" blinkmacsystemfont,=\"\" \"segoe=\"\" ui\",=\"\" roboto,=\"\" \"helvetica=\"\" neue\",=\"\" arial,=\"\" \"noto=\"\" sans\",=\"\" sans-serif,=\"\" \"apple=\"\" color=\"\" emoji\",=\"\" ui=\"\" symbol\",=\"\" emoji\";=\"\" color:=\"\" rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0);=\"\" font-si