201000001046062\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">₹20,000 - </span>₹35,000</p></td><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001046062\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">₹35,000 - </span>₹45,000</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001046062\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">Whitefield</span></p></td><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001046062\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">8 km</span></p></td><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001046062\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">Apartments, Villas</span></p></td><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001046062\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">₹10,000 - </span>₹15,000</p></td><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001046062\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">₹15,000 - </span>₹32,000</p></td><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001046062\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">₹25,000 - </span>₹40,000</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001046062\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">Brookefield</span></p></td><td><p>5-7km</p></td><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001046062\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">Commercial + Residential</span></p></td><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001046062\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">₹12,000 -₹17,000</span></p></td><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001046062\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">₹18,000 -₹35,000</span></p></td><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001046062\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">₹25,000 -₹40,000</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><h2 style=\"margin: 12pt 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\"><b>Conclusion</b></h2><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" size\":\"12.00\",\"fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-margin-top=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin: 12pt 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\">When considering your decision to live near Prestige Tech Park you must think about connectivity, property value, and amenities and lifestyle. Kadubeesanahalli, Marathahalli, Panathur Road, Whitefield, Brookefield, and Bellandur have excellent infrastructure and accessibility.<br></p><p>Panathur Road is on a rapid rate of development, with more housing and shorter commute, Whitefield can fulfil all your needs and is totally self-sustained, especially for schools and healthcare. Brookefield has the best combination of urban life and green life. Bellandur and Marathahalli are aligned with prime commercial hubs. Kadubeesanahalli is on the periphery of suburbia with a touch of urban life.</p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p>",
